Article 7

The duties of the PUG Working Group include:

a. promoting and facilitating dialogue between work units within the scope of regional government;
b. developing work networks in accordance with the main duties, functions and authorities given by the leadership in efforts to realize gender equality and justice;
c. assigning the technical team to prepare the PUG RAD in order to realize gender equality and justice adjusted to the RPJMD periodization;
d. elaborating and following up on policies and implementation programs to be gender responsive that are implicit and explicit in the RPJMD;
e. coordinating the establishment of PUG Focal Points in each PD or work unit;
